---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SlushTec — You act. The world keeps score."
  description="Indie game studio building adult interactive worlds with permanent consequences. Home of VARP (Virtual Action Role Play) and Ashcourt — Hell Rises."
>
  <!-- Hero — tighter -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-10 pb-12 sm:pt-12 sm:pb-14">
    <p class="text-warm-earth text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">
      Indie Game Studio · Tucson, Arizona
    </p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-[3.25rem] font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.15]">
      You act.<br />
      <span class="text-golden-glow">The world keeps score.</span>
    </h1>
    <div class="score-line mt-5 mb-6 max-w-sm"></div>
    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
      SlushTec builds adult interactive worlds with permanent residual.
      Free-form action. Bidirectional relationships that can rise or collapse.
      A living street that remembers what you did.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a
        href="/projects"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded bg-warm-earth text-iron font-medium hover:bg-golden-glow transition"
      >
        View Projects
      </a>
      <a
        href="/about"
        class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded border border-surface text-gray-200 hover:border-warm-earth hover:text-warm-earth transition"
      >
        About the Studio
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What we build -->
  <section class="border-t border-surface bg-surface/40">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-12">
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-golden-glow mb-6 tracking-tight">What we build</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
        <a href="/projects#varp" class="block p-5 rounded-lg badge-border group">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-white group-hover:text-warm-earth transition">VARP</h3>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Virtual Action Role Play — a Virtual LARP engine with permanent memory,
            modular original World Packs, and bidirectional relationships that keep score.
          </p>
        </a>
        <a href="/projects#ashcourt" class="block p-5 rounded-lg badge-border group">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-white group-hover:text-warm-earth transition">Ashcourt</h3>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Hell Rises — original-IP dark fantasy narrative aRPG.
            Also the flagship World Pack for VARP.
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Design pillars -->
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 sm:py-12">
    <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold text-golden-glow mb-5 tracking-tight">Design pillars</h2>
    <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base">
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium shrink-0">01</span> Permanent score — fail forward, no paid undo</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium shrink-0">02</span> Bidirectional relationships that can collapse</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium shrink-0">03</span> World-pack authenticity over generic helpfulness</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium shrink-0">04</span> Local-first residual ownership</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium shrink-0">05</span> Worlds, not agendas</li>
      <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-warm-earth font-medium shrink-0">06</span> Minors: hard no</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
